==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm|en}} {{term|softely|lang=enm}}, {{term|softeliche|lang=enm}}, equivalent to {{suffix|soft|ly|lang=en|nocat=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-softly.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Adverb===
{{en-adv|er|more}}

# In a [[soft]] manner; [[gently]].
# Not [[loudly]]; nearly [[inaudible]].

====Related terms====
* [[softly softly]]

